WHAT IS FREE AND WHAT IS PAID
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Everything in this repository is free and open under the MIT License. There is no
paid tier of this source, no feature withheld behind a license key in it, and no
obligation to buy anything in order to run it. Connect the application to a server
you run yourself and you pay nothing, forever.

What ToolsEnabled sells is OPERATING a server, not the right to any code. That
paid service is called ToolsEnabled Anywhere: the managed connectivity service
and the relay we host, the secure phone path and mobile access through the
website to your own agent systems, the hosted vault storage service, and the
account, billing and entitlement services. None of that is in this repository.
Running your own server for these capabilities is free; the reason to pay is
that you would rather we ran one for you.

